            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0674" n="668" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">781.003/276h: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Diplomatic Agent and
                        Consul General at Tangier</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Blake</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-09-06T17:00:00-04:00">September 6, 1939—5
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. Has Childs arrived? If so, has he been able to ascertain whether Marchal
                    still plans to commence negotiations this autumn or whether they are likely to
                    be indefinitely postponed?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
